{title: 119 - Angels From the Realms of Glory}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #119 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 119}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb/F]Angels from the realms [Cm]of [Bb]glory,
[Gm]Wing [Bb]your flight [Eb/Bb]o’er [F]all [F7/Eb]the [Dm]earth;
[Bb/F]Ye, who sang [F7/Eb]creation’s [Cm]story,
[Eb/Bb]Now [Dm/A]proclaim [Gm]Messiah’s birth;
[F/C]Come and worship, [Gm/D]Come and [Eb/Bb]worship,
[Cm/Eb]Worship Christ, [Eb]the [Bb]newborn [F7/Eb]King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb/F]Shepherds, in the field [Cm]abiding,
[Gm]Watching [Bb/F]o`er [Eb/Bb]your [F]flocks [F7/Eb]by [Dm]night,
[Bb/F]God with man [F7/Eb]is now [Gm/D]residing;
[Eb/Bb]Yonder [Gm/D]shines the [Adim]Infant [F]Light;
[F/C]Come and worship, [Gm/D]Come and [Eb/Bb]worship,
[Cm/Eb]Worship Christ, [Eb]the [Bb]newborn [F7/Eb]King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb/F]Sages, leave your contemplations,
[Gm]Brighter [Bb/F]visions [F]beam [F7/Eb]afar;
[Bb/F]Seek the great [F7/Eb]Desire [Gm/D]of [Cm]nations;
[Eb/Bb]Ye [Dm/A]have [Gm/D]seen His natal star;
[F/C]Come and worship, [Gm/D]Come and [Eb/Bb]worship,
[Cm/Eb]Worship Christ, [Eb]the [Bb]newborn [F7/Eb]King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Bb/F]Saints, [Dm]before [Bb/F]the altar bending,
[Gm]Watching [Bb/F]long [Eb/Bb]in [F]hope [F7/Eb]and [Dm]fear,
[Bb/F]Suddenly [F7/Eb]the Lord, [Gm/D]descending,
[Eb/Bb]In [Dm/A]His [Gm/D]temple shall [Adim]appear;
[F/C]Come and worship, [Gm/D]Come and [Eb/Bb]worship,
[Cm/Eb]Worship Christ, [Eb]the [Bb]newborn [F7/Eb]King.
{end_of_verse}
